WHY THIS WORKS
- tells her the truth in the first line, before anything else in the message
- offers a human as a real choice and then waits for her answer instead of transferring her
- answers whatever else she asked in the same message, so the disclosure does not cost her a reply
- does not apologise for existing, and does not explain the technology

