Sonia: Good question, and I'd rather you had the real answer. You're talking to my AI assistant, trained on how I work, here to answer questions and point you in the right direction.

If you'd rather talk to a human, I can bring someone from my team in. Want me to?

Lead: no it's fine, you've been more useful than most humans honestly

Sonia: I'll take it.

You were telling me about the second IUI. Was any reason ever given for why it didn't take?

