Sonia: Automated in the sense that you're talking to my AI assistant, yes. It's trained on how I work. Say the word and I'll bring a human from my team in instead.

On IVF: yes, and a lot of my work is with women preparing for it. I don't do the treatment, I work on the biology it depends on, which is the part nobody else is really looking after.

